window.products.push({"id":322107,"name":"LISUNQUE 100pcs Canning Lids Wide Mouth | Canning Lids Only | Wide Mouth Mason Jar Lids for Ball and Kerr | Bulk Jar Lids for Canning| Thick Split-Typ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818koOow2HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100-Count,Premium Wide Mouth Canning Lids for Ball Mason Kerr Jars Silver,Split-Type Metal Mason Jar Lids for Canning - Food Grade Material. 100% Fit & Airtight for Regular Mouth Jars Product Specification: Material: high quality tinplate Color: Silver Size: Wide Mouth Wide Mouth Size: Jar lid diameter 86mm/3.38in Quantity: 100pcs canning jar lids Reusable or One Time Use? If the lid hasn't been damaged or bent out of shape it can be reused for vacuum sealing again. It could be washed in the dishwasher. After washing, you should wiped off the moisture to prevent it from rusting. How to use the jar lids? 1. Put the jam, pickles, fruit, salad and others you need to store in the mason bottle. 2. Put on our canning lids on the ring cap,please be careful not to tighten it too tightly, so as to better let the air out and ensure the tightness. 3. Heat the mason bottle in a pot under cold water to boil 8 to 10 minutes, then take out the mason bottle and let it cool naturally. 4. Discharge the gas in the bottle when it is heated, then use the principle of thermal expansion and contraction. 5. After the gas is cooled, a negative pressure will be generated to achieve the sealing. Super sealing ensure airtightness and prevents leakage providing a hassle-free storage solution.Keep your foods freshly preserved with a set of wide-mouth Ball Mason Jar Lids . The canning lids offer the sealing quality that canners have trusted for generations. These wide mouth mason jar lids work by ensuring no oxygen gets into the canning jar, your food remains preserved just the way you created it. Whether you're preserving jam to enjoy for long periods of time or storing freshly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818koOow2HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"N|C","source_asin":"B098X4MKTJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-322107","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098X4MKTJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098X4MKTJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
