window.products.push({"id":322118,"name":"Ice Cream Molds Popsicle Molds Silicone Heart Shapes, 2 Pack 4 Cavities Cake Pop Mold, Oval Cakesicle Molds with 50 Wooden Sticks 50 Bags for Kids","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a3pv1jHEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The popsicle molds are composed of 100% Food Grade Silicone. You can use this mold for making your popsicle without worry.  Funny creative! DIY ice cream once time will make your life more attractive. Feature: The ice pop molds silicone are easy to use, and they are soft and non-stick.  Each ice cream mold can be stackable, saving the space in the freezer. It can keep away from absoring refrigerator odors as well.  Making ice pops at home will be easier when you have this Popsicle Mold. More fun in your life.  Pour your favorite ingredients into the mold, making up to different uniquely flavored pops at once.  Come on enjoying wonderful handmade moments and delicious Popsicle with your children.  Silicone molds safe for microwave, oven, freezer, and dishwasher.  Cake pop maker is durable and Long-lasting, Easy to use and easy to clean up. Ice Cream Recipe: 1,Wash the mould and boil it in boiling water for 10 minutes in order to disinfect it.  2, Pour a proper amount of juice or milk into the mould, but not too full.  3, Put the ice cream stick into the mould and freeze it in the refrigerator for more than 4 hours.  4, Place them 1 to 2 minutes after freezing, twist the mold up and down and press the bottom. Note:: Please clean the mold and wash them in boiling water before use.  Please notice the size of the mold before ordering, make sure that’s what you want. Specification: Material:100% Food Grade Silicone  Heart Popsicle Molds Size: 14.44 inch * 5.66 inch* 0.98 inch  Heart Cavity Size: 3.42 inch * 3.30 inch  Oval Popsicle Molds Size:7.48 inch * 4.33 inch* 0.87 inch  Oval Cavity Size: 2.55 inch * 1.18 inch Package Included: 1* Heart Popsicle Mold 1* Oval Popsicle Mold 50 * Wooden Sticks 50 * Popsicle Bags","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a3pv1jHEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AuchSo","source_asin":"B091H4CSV3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-322118","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091H4CSV3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091H4CSV3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
