window.products.push({"id":322349,"name":"Silicone Pancake Spatula, Wide Flexible Silicone Turner for Non Stick Cookware, Round Pancake Flipper Spatula Heat Resistant Cooking Turner with Stain","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31RVcsustdL._AC_.jpg","description":"🔹 Safe & Reliable --- ENLOY silicone turner is made of food-grade silicone and high quality stainless steel. It is nontoxic, no smell, corrosion-resistant and BPA free. These ensure you cook your lunch or dinner every day safely. The pancake turner features a flexible stainless steel core for added stability and durability. 🔹 Innovative Design --- ENLOY silicone turner has a thin and flexible edge that slide easily under food. The flexible edge is safe for your expensive nonstick cookware without scratching it. The wide silicone spatula is perfect for flipping pancakes, burgers, pizza, omelette, steak, fish and other food. You will cook a delicious lunch or a nutritious dinner for yourself or your family. The gap of the silicone spatula is designed to remove extra oil while you cook. 🔹 Easy to clean & Practical --- The silicone spatula is non-stick, easy to clean and dishwasher safe, which will save your time and improve the work efficiency. Highly heat resistant material ensures you cook nontoxic and healthy food every day. ENLOY silicone turner has a soft, heat resistant, non-slip handle. This ergonomically designed handle with thumb groove ensures maximum comfort and control. 🔹 High Quality & Handy --- ENLOY silicone turner is fine workmanship and high quality. The spatula is not easy to deform and not easy to be broken. The silicone head of the turner and the stainless steel handle is not easy to separate, which allows the turner can serve as a kitchen utensil for long time use. The kitchen spatula has a hanging hole for easy storage that keeps your kitchen clean. 🔹 Excellent Service --- If you're not completely satisfied with your purchase, simply let us know and you'll be offered a FULL refund or replacement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31RVcsustdL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ENLOY","source_asin":"B07CN9LTVQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-322349","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CN9LTVQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CN9LTVQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":322350,"name":"Kinchoix Projection Alarm Clock for Bedroom, FM Radio 2 USB Charging Ports, 180° Rotable Projector, Dual Alarm, Snooze, LED Digital Clock for Heavy Sl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mdYa-uy0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With simple and intuitive buttons, the bedroom projection clock is very easy to set up, even for the elderly who are not familiar with digital technology equipment. Super clear time projection, the blue numbers are prominent, fonts are large and easy to read. -90°-90° Rotating projector. 5-10 ft/ 1.5-3 m optimal projection distance. Long press for 2-3s, it will flip projection view upside down 180°. 3 level projection brightness (high -dim -off)  Tip: You can use the fine-tuning knob on the back of the projector to make the time more focused. 6-inch ultra-clear LED screen, suitable for the elderly and myopia people. 0-100% display brightness steplessly adjustable. Support 12/24 H time format. The alarm clock has a button battery with a memory function, which can store the set time and FM channel even during a power outage. The button battery does not have the function of storing power. Alarm clock needs to be plugged into the DC adapter to display it. When you feel boring at home, open the FM radio to find some fun. FM radio 87.5-108.0 MHz FM channel. 15 volume levels adjustable. 5-90 minutes FM sleep time can be set. Long press the triangle button to automatically search for stable stations. Users can store up to 10 favorite radio stations Tip: In order to get a better sound reception, please stay away from the interference signal source and fully extend the soft antenna. 12/24 hour time display Change the 12/24H time format according to your habits. If the 12-hour display mode is selected, the “P” indicator will light up in the afternoon and go out automatically in the morning. 2 alarms and big snooze button The projector clock adopts a dual alarm clock design, which allows you to set 2 independent wake-up times. Simply press the big snooze button to get an extra 5-60 minutes of sleep or rest time. Dual USB charging ports  There are two 5 A / 1.0 A USB output ports on the back o","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mdYa-uy0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kinchoix","source_asin":"B09JVPCDDX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-322350","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JVPCDDX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JVPCDDX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
