window.products.push({"id":322531,"name":"6 Reversible 8x10 Gaming Posters, Video Gamer Room Decor For Boys, Gamer Birthday Party Supplies, Game Room Posters For Boys Room Decorations For Bedr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kMYOnYHoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ready to get your game on?   Create your son's dream room with this video game room decor. Whether you're looking to upgrade a nursery into a big boy's room, restyle or level up your child's current bedroom, or you're just looking for awesome birthday party gaming room decor to give your son a birthday he'll always remember, our gaming decor for boys room is a simple and affordable way to easily create a gaming play room your child will love.   Gamer decor for boys room video game wall art  8x10 inches, featuring 6 reversible gamer wall decor prints  Thick and sturdy cardstock that won’t bend  Matte finish to prevent glares  Perfectly fits inside a frame (frame not included)   As mothers, we want to make sure our little gamers are receiving the very best. That's why our video game decor includes cool and funny phrases that your son will love to show off to his gamer friends. Each morning when he wakes up and looks at his video game posters, he'll be excited to take on his day and defeat any challenge presented to him.   This kids bedroom decor for boys features 6 double-sided prints, for a total of 12 designs, so you get an extra 6 designs at no additional cost. Simply mix and match these controller themed video game poster bedroom wall decor prints in any order and instantly change the look of any room in just minutes. These gaming room decor for boys bedroom decorations are perfect to use as gamer posters for boys room and gamer bedroom decor for boys.   Our family-owned business wants to help you create memories that last a lifetime. Our video game player boy room decorations for bedroom are designed to bring families together. Designed and printed in the USA, our 6 piece poster for boys room wall art will last for your son's entire childhood. If you have any questions about our computer game room wall decor or boys decor for bedroom decorations, please don't hesitate to reach out.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kMYOnYHoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hadley Designs","source_asin":"B09BKB389D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-322531","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BKB389D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BKB389D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
