window.products.push({"id":322776,"name":"Alishomtll Floral Plant Tapestry Colorful Herb Tapestries Wild Flower Plants Tapestry Nature Scenery Butterfly Tapestries for Room (51.2 x 59.1 inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.51,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rSLVSzqKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Designer Says: How charming the artistic idea is! The floral plant art will give your room some secret color. This piece of artwork tapestry would be a perfect gift. Smurfs Yingda -- Make Everyday Living Easier: As a comprehensive home textile company, Smurfs Yingda strives to help people organize and enhance their home with high quality & lower price products! Premium Quality Material: Being made of polyester, the colorful herb tapestry is high-quality, durable and lightweight, which is friendly to the environment and yourself. HD Printing Technology: With vibrant color and unique design, these wild flower tapestries will give your room a wonderful nature landscape, adopting the HD printing technology. Never worry about fading. Easy to Install & Clean: You can easily hang this wild flower plants tapestry with decorative tacks or push pins. Don’t have to worry about how hard it is to install it. Hand wash or machine wash in the cold water in a gentle way. Hang dry only. Please iron it at lower temperature. Four Available Sizes : Our nature scenery butterfly tapestry sizes: 51.2 x 59.1 inches, 59.1 x 59.1 inches, 59.1 x 82.7 inches and 70.9 x 92.5 inches. Please choose one best suits your room. Package Included: 1 × Floral Plant Tapestry Warm Notice: Color difference is allowed due to light and screen effects. 1-2cm/0.4” - 0.8” is allowed due to manual measurement. CLICK THE YELLOW 'ADD TO CART' BUTTON ABOVE to send it to your family, friends, guests. It absolutely will become the best gift what they receive.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rSLVSzqKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alishomtll","source_asin":"B089NFJ6G2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-322776","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089NFJ6G2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089NFJ6G2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":322777,"name":"Bissell ProHeat 2X CleanShot Upright Deep Cleaner, Red Berends, 9500","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41lyhVU-GvL._AC_.jpg","description":"Using the power of heat, brushes, and cleaning formula, this upright home cleaning system removes deep-down dirt for a maximum clean. The unit's built-in heater heats hot tap water up to 25 degrees hotter for maximum results, plus it offers a no-heat option for cleaning delicate wool or oriental rugs. Choose between light clean, normal, heavy traffic, and rinse settings; the cleaner will adjust the right amount of cleaning solution to mix with the heated water. Its two DirtLifter PowerBrush rolls feature a bristle pattern that safely lifts out dirt while gently grooming carpet fibers. Tackle especially tough stains with the push of a button thanks to the CleanShot feature. It sprays a concentrated stream of cleaning solution, penetrating the stain and allowing for better cleaning focus. Simply spray and suction and the stain disappears. Even more, the unit's Dry Aire system spreads hot air across the carpet to help dry it. Other details include floating suspension that self-adjusts to all carpet heights, a two-in-one water tank that keeps clean and dirty water separate, floor cleaning or above-floor cleaning with the turn of a knob, and deep-cleaning formulas with Scotchgard protector. Tools include a 3-inch tough-stain tool, a 4-inch upholstery tool, a spraying crevice tool, a 6-inch stair tool, a TurboBrush, and a mesh bag. Also included: a 16-ounce container of Fiber Cleansing Formula. Great for carpet, upholstery, stairs, and car interiors, the deep cleaner measures 19 by 13 by 44 inches and carries a one-year limited warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41lyhVU-GvL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bissell","source_asin":"B000RPTV62","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-322777","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000RPTV62","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000RPTV62","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
