window.products.push({"id":322850,"name":"Qozary 4 Pack Drawer Organizers for Clothing, 10 Grids Foldable Dresser Drawer Organizers, Clothes Organizer for Folded Clothes, T-shirt, Tank Tops, C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":40.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D0vDDuOmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"3 SIZES FOR YOU TO CHOOSE: This clothes organizer for folded clothes has 3 sizes, the 10 Grids-Small is suitable for thin T-shirts, tank tops, camisoles, etc.; the 6 Grids-Small size is suitable for short-sleeved T-shirts, tights, leggings, etc.; the 6 Grids-Medium is suitable for long-sleeved T-shirts and other adult clothes. You can choose the suitable size according to the clothes you need to organize. 8 Grids-Small size is 40 x 23 x 10 cm / 15.75 x 9.06 x 3.94 in. 10 GRID ORGANIZER FOR THIN T-SHIRT: This 10 grids T-shirt organizer box increases the number of compartments to store more clothing. It can be used to organize your thin T-shirts, leggings and tank tops, and also can be used to organize your camisoles, underwear, socks, and even your winter accessories such as gloves, scarves, brimless beanies, and more. EASY ACCESS & SPACE SAVING: The underwear organizer are perfect to save space for your closet, drawer, wardrobe and cabinet, helping your drawers become more tidy and neat. If you use it for your kid's drawers, they can see all of the tees and quickly find what they want to wear every day, saving time. These can be used in numerous ways to organize your belongings. EASY TO ASSEMBLE & FOLDABLE: This legging organizer for closet is light in weight, small in size, and foldable. You can quickly assemble this clothes drawer organizer by inserting the supported PP board. And you can fold it when you don't need it without taking up your drawer space. PREMIUM QUALITY MATERIAL: The shirt organizer for folded clothes are made of PBT fabric, which is moisture-proof and very durable. The square boards are made of PP (Polypropylene), which is high heat-proof, smooth and light. These drawer organizers for clothing are washable, but the fabric contains a hard PP board, so please wash them by hand instead of using the machine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D0vDDuOmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Qozary","source_asin":"B0BVM5XXMN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-322850","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVM5XXMN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVM5XXMN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":322851,"name":"Polish Pottery Coffee Mug Bubble 12 oz Flowing Blues","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51NzGtNYnRL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Polish Pottery Bubble Mug 12 oz Flowing Blues Dimensions: 3¾\" wide, 5\" long, 3¾\" high Capacity: 12oz Polmedia Polish Pottery Stoneware is: * Hand crafted and hand painted in Boleslawiec, Poland * Microwave safe, dishwasher safe, oven safe up to 480 F, freezer safe * Lead and cadmium free * Crack and chip resistant * Intended for everyday use, easy to clean * Highly collectable About Polish Pottery Polish pottery is known for its versatility in the kitchen and on the table. It is safe for use with food in the microwave, freezer, oven and dishwasher. Polish stoneware is resilient to abrasives making it durable and resistant to scratching or chipping. It distributes heat evenly for perfect baking and is also nonstick for easy clean-up, making it easy to care for. The bright patterns never fade, and are offered in thousands of variations to mix and match. It is this combination of function and beauty that makes Polish pottery so appealing. The pottery is fired in electric and gas kilns at temperatures exceeding 2200 degrees Fahrenheit. This results in a stoneware that is meant to resist aging and provide lasting beauty that stands the test of time. Polish stoneware is lead and cadmium free.Polish Pottery is hand crafted and hand painted in the Boleslawiec region of Poland. This region is famous for its naturally found white clay which artisans have used for centuries to craft this durable and beautiful stoneware. Each piece of pottery is carefully formed and painted by hand to ensure that exceptional attention to detail is paid to each piece. The most beautiful and intricate patterns are called UNIKAT patterns. These patterns bear the artist’s signature.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51NzGtNYnRL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Polmedia Polish Pottery","source_asin":"B011J3DBPM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-322851","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B011J3DBPM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B011J3DBPM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
