window.products.push({"id":322946,"name":"Silicone Toilet Brush 2 Pack, Flexer Silicone Toilet Brush and Holder for Bathroom Toilet Cleaning Flexersilicone Toilet Brush Deep Cleaning, Flexer B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yEKBBFthL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Sliding Removable Drainage Base】The silicone toilet brush and holder has a stable and breathable base, pull-out sliding bottom design, removable drainage, easy to drain the water at the bottom of the toilet brush at any time, no need to pick up the entire base, will not stain the ground, keep the floor and wall dry and odorless. Come with 2 toilet bowl cleaner brush, meet your different needs, rooms or floors. 【Easy to Clean Any Corner】The toilet bowl cleaner brush head adopts a flat design, soft and can be bent 180 degrees, with a long handle, easily reach any difficult-to-clean edges, corners, gaps, etc., can better clean the toilet edge, sink gap, and floor corners, or other uneven places. 【High-Quality Materials & Space Saving】Toilet bowl brush and holder set is made of sturdy and durable TPR + PP material, safe, environmentally friendly without pollution, no rusty problem, reduces the frequency of replacing the toilet cleaner brush due to rust. You can put the toilet brush on the ground or stick it on the wall, without drilling holes. Compact size for storage and organization, save your space. 【Silicone Bristles & Easy Clean】Silicone bristles make the toilet cleaner brush not easy to entangle the hair or other stains, easy to clean, just washing with water after use. The silicone brush head can dry quickly and has no peculiar smell. The bristles are softer and protect the toilet from scratches. 【Modern & Multi-Scene Use】Modern design, simple and beautiful appearance, can be perfectly integrated with any decoration style. The toilet bowl brush can be used not only for toilets, but also for cleaning walls, floors, sinks, wash basins and bathtubs, etc, quickly clean all kinds of tiles and glass. If you have any questions about the toilet bowl brush or our service, please feel free to contact us and we will solve any problems for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yEKBBFthL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eibodian","source_asin":"B09N6STHGY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-322946","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N6STHGY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N6STHGY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
